WEBVTT

00:08:56.579 --> 00:09:01.204
And I am failing, you know,
on occasion, you know,

00:09:01.246 --> 00:09:06.996
but feels but now that I've changed
the goal to stretching

00:09:06.996 --> 00:09:14.412
and learning instead of proving and
perfecting. It feels so different.

00:09:14.496 --> 00:09:15.496
Does that make sense?

00:09:15.496 --> 00:09:18.662
It does it it resonates. And I've
I guess I've I've gone through

00:09:18.662 --> 00:09:20.454
a similar shift in saying, look,

00:09:20.912 --> 00:09:25.079
I want to be the kind of person who takes
on projects that matter. Yes.

00:09:25.246 --> 00:09:28.371
And where I have the potential to
contribute something meaningful.

00:09:28.704 --> 00:09:31.996
And even if I fail, at least
I didn't fail to try.